WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.425
Greenhouse gases slow the loss of infrared, keeping Earth warmer.

2
00:00:05.276 --> 00:00:10.351
Greenhouse gases absorb infrared from the surface and send some back down.

3
00:00:16.355 --> 00:00:20.330
Without them, Earth would cool to about minus eighteen degrees.

4
00:00:21.057 --> 00:00:25.182
Extra greenhouse gases do the opposite, and Earth warms.
